						<![CDATA[Delay
Delay the removal of the site op until it is ready to be removed.  This can prevent visual glitches in some circumstance, like when CActorSiteOpTilter needs to finish tilting a unit upright for a brief moment after an ability that causes tilting is complete.]]>
