Specifies a tangent that points towards the previous (in) or next (out) control point.  This creates a linear change in the animated value as it moves into or out of the control point.  It results in sawtooth-like curves comprised of straight line segments.]]>
					</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:enumeration>
			<xs:enumeration value="TangentSlow">
