						</xs:complexType>
					</xs:element>
					<xs:element minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1" name="EventDataFootprintActor" type="CActorCreateKey">
						<xs:annotation>
							<xs:documentation>
								<![CDATA[Event Footprint Actor
In the Model Data you can configure Events that will display actual footprints left by a unit's movement. The actor specified here will be created to display the left or right footprints.]]>
							</xs:documentation>
						</xs:annotation>
					</xs:element>
					<xs:element minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded" name="EventDataSound">
						<xs:annotation>
							<xs:documentation>
								<![CDATA[Event Sound
In the Model Data you can configure Events that will play sounds at a specific point in an animation. The sound specified here will be played at that point in the animation.]]>
							</xs:documentation>
						</xs:annotation>
						<xs:complexType>
							<xs:complexContent>
								<xs:extension base="SEventDataSound">
