					<xs:annotation>
						<xs:documentation>
							<![CDATA[Scale Damage Maximum
The maximum amount of damage that corresponds to the maximum radius value. The scale of the shield ripple is calculated by comparing the damaged received with the minimum and maximum damage values and applying that ratio to the minimum and maximum radius.]]>
						</xs:documentation>
					</xs:annotation>
				</xs:attribute>
