				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>
						<![CDATA[Time Signature
The time signature of this section. X/Y where the top number says how many notes of Y type are in each bar.  For instance 3,4 would be a 3/4 time signature which means there are three (3) quarter-notes (4) per bar.]]>
